infographic sequence-snake-steps-underline-text
data
  title The four-move refactor that opens a cycle
  desc A mechanical sequence — none of it changes behaviour; median packages touched per PR fell 3.4 to 1.6
  sequences
    - label Dissolve models
      desc Move each struct to the package that owns its lifecycle; give consumers a narrow view-struct, not the shared 40-field type
    - label Flip the cycle
      desc Replace the reverse call with a consumer-side interface (billing.CustomerSource); the wiring layer adapts customer to it
    - label Dissolve util
      desc Move each function next to its only caller — 62 of 91 had exactly one; promote shared survivors into real packages: retry, clock, money
    - label Fence with internal/
      desc Move everything no other service consumes under internal/; the next convenient-but-wrong import is now a compile error
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #f59e0b #f43f5e
